323946,BSE-138495,master,9" Smoking Cauldron,9" Smoking Cauldron,2.030,0,0,,"Please Note: Products are designed and rated for use in the United States using 120 volt current. With or without a transformer, this product is not recommended for use outside the US. Smoking Cauldron includes: (1) Plastic Mat (approximately 15"" wide x 15"" high), (1) Plastic Cauldron (approximately 9"" high x 6.5"" wide), (1) Mist Deflector (Fogger Unit) that creates fog, has flashing lights and changes colors, (1) Indoor UL Listed Adapter with 6' long power cord, (1) Plastic Fogger Stand that fits inside the Cauldron. Also includes a plastic Splash Guard to keep the Fogger Unit from splashing. Just put the Fogger Unit inside the Splash Guard and place inside the Fogger Stand. Regular tap water gets the smoke-y fog rolling and the multi-colored light inside the cauldron shines from inside to create a magical decoration! Please Note: Cauldron needs water to be added regularly to keep the Mist Deflector (Fog Unit) running. Keep water between the MIN and MAX lines.<br /><br /> Material: Fogger: 100% Metal; Cauldron: Plastic<br /><br /> Country of Origin: China<br /><br /> Care Instruction: Use ordinary tap water. Fog mist may cause moisture or water to accumulate on the area around the cauldron. Place plastic mat (included) under cauldron. For Indoor use only!<br /><br /> Celebration: Halloween<br /><br /> Gender: Unisex<br /><br /> Age Group: Adult",,0,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,9,9.250,7.250,1000,Y,55278,BuySeasons/Decorations & Props,,32.300,,Monday 13 October 2014 09:24:48 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,2241,628481194522,22.670,41,N,219,BuySeasons
